            "answer": "<p>For Clinical spa therapists and  skincare specialists, precision working angles are essential for accurate protocol execution. The heavy-duty hydraulic pump system enables effortless vertical positioning to the desired working height, letting practitioners adjust the working elevation with a simple foot pedal while keeping their hands clean. Practitioners can elevate or lower the client to the exact height needed for optimal sightlines, minimizing visual fatigue and improving service consistency.</p>"
